#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/13-iot_Bluetooth_piano.rst:17
msgid "13. Bluetooth Piano"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/13-iot_Bluetooth_piano.rst:26
msgid "A buzzer becomes a piano. Send ``NOTE_C4*`` and it plays a C for a fifth of a second."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/13-iot_Bluetooth_piano.rst:28
msgid "The interesting part is the star: it marks the **end** of a message, so the sketch knows when a whole note name has arrived and does not try to play ``NOTE_C`` before the rest of the name is there."
msgstr ""

